><span begin="00:19.000" end="00:19.150">were </span><span begin="00:19.150" end="00:19.630">planes </span><span begin="00:19.630" end="00:19.750">to </span><span begin="00:19.750" end="00:20.530">catch</span><span begin="00:20.530" end="00:20.590">, </span><span begin="00:20.590" end="00:20.770">and </span><span begin="00:20.770" end="00:21.220">bills </span><span begin="00:21.220" end="00:21.340">to </span><span begin="00:21.340" end="00:22.510">pay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.540" end="00:25.570"><span begin="00:22.540" end="00:22.750">He </span><span begin="00:22.750" end="00:23.050">learned </span><span begin="00:23.050" end="00:23.140">to </span><span begin="00:23.140" end="00:23.560">walk </span><span begin="00:23.560" end="00:23.890">while </span><span begin="00:23.890" end="00:23.950">I </span><span begin="00:23.950" end="00:24.310">was </span><span begin="00:24.310" end="00:25.030">away</span><span begin="00:25.030" end="00:25.060">, </span><span begin="00:25.060" end="00:25.240">and </span><span begin="00:25.240" end="00:25.360">he </span><span begin="00:25.360" end="00:25.570">was</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.570" end="00:29.050"><span begin="00:25.570" end="00:25.990">Talkin </span><span begin="00:25.990" end="00:26.290">fore </span><span begin="00:26.290" end="00:26.350">I </span><span begin="00:26.350" end="00:26.650">knew </span><span begin="00:26.650" end="00:26.950">it</span><span begin="00:26.950" end="00:27.010">, </span><span begin="00:27.010" end="00:27.250">and </span><span begin="00:27.250" end="00:27.460">as </span><span begin="00:27.460" end="00:27.550">he </span><span begin="00:27.550" end="00:28.030">grew</span><span begin="00:28.030" end="00:28.150">, </span><span begin="00:28.150" end="00:28.360">he </span><span begin="00:28.360" end="00:28.660">said</span><span begin="00:28.660" end="00:29.050">:</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.050" end="00:31.840"><span begin="00:29.050" end="00:29.230">Im </span><spa